WEBVTT

00:03.530 --> 00:06.520
Wow, I was so sleepy during that last class!

00:06.520 --> 00:08.340
Yuki-kun, what are you looking at?

00:10.030 --> 00:14.750
Like I said, stop interacting with me. You'll start some annoying rumors.

00:14.750 --> 00:17.150
I don't care about rumors.

00:17.150 --> 00:19.240
We're childhood friends. Who cares?

00:19.740 --> 00:23.020
You clearly don't, but the others do.

00:23.020 --> 00:25.810
Yuki-kun, your hair's really grown.

00:25.810 --> 00:28.370
You look gloomy with one 
eye hidden like that.

00:28.370 --> 00:29.010
Hey.

00:29.010 --> 00:31.460
Shall I cut it for you like before?

00:34.930 --> 00:37.630
Yuhi, you never change.

00:37.630 --> 00:40.210
To me, you always have been 
and always will be Yuki-kun.

00:40.210 --> 00:42.790
That will never change!

00:43.800 --> 00:45.440
Sure, I guess. I'll let you do it soon.

00:45.440 --> 00:49.070
Gotcha. I'll make you look super cool!

00:51.090 --> 00:54.950
<i>I wonder how the "other world" is doing.</i>

00:57.670 --> 00:58.420
What?

00:58.420 --> 01:00.150
Hey, what's going on?!

01:03.500 --> 01:04.760
What is this?

01:08.900 --> 01:10.020
<i>Could it be...</i>

01:28.010 --> 01:29.820
What is this?

01:29.820 --> 01:32.230
We were at school, right?

01:33.810 --> 01:36.350
I knew it! This is...

01:38.960 --> 01:40.200
Yuki-kun?

01:40.920 --> 01:42.280
Hey, do you hear something?

01:52.230 --> 01:54.000
Wh-What's that?

01:54.000 --> 01:55.760
It's a movie shoot, right?

02:00.190 --> 02:01.640
Magic power.

02:03.670 --> 02:05.570
Hey, are we in trouble?!

02:05.570 --> 02:06.960
They're coming this way!

02:06.960 --> 02:08.770
Everyone, run! Run now!

02:12.930 --> 02:14.160
Yuki-kun!

02:26.960 --> 02:28.730
Huh? Yuki-kun?!

02:29.720 --> 02:31.710
Wait, did I just...

02:31.710 --> 02:33.590
Not now. Let's run. Come on!

02:33.590 --> 02:35.710
H-Hey, Yuki-kun!

02:43.680 --> 02:45.100
Yuki-kun! Up front!

02:48.550 --> 02:49.630
Forward!

02:49.630 --> 02:51.950
Destroy the demons!

02:58.530 --> 03:01.690
Magic squad, fire!

03:21.030 --> 03:22.840
What's going on?

03:23.130 --> 03:25.850
<i>These wars should have ended by now.</i>

03:27.840 --> 03:31.020
<i>That magic power... Is it a curse?!</i>

03:31.640 --> 03:36.110
<i>This feeling... It's unmistakable. 
It has to be...</i>

03:37.170 --> 03:38.600
Yuki-kun?

03:38.600 --> 03:39.540
You there!

03:41.030 --> 03:42.450
What are you doing?

03:42.900 --> 03:46.080
This place isn't safe. Retreat now!

03:48.390 --> 03:51.860
The Royal Knights will 
protect you. Now go!

03:51.860 --> 03:52.830
R-Right!

03:53.480 --> 03:54.690
All right. Let's go!

03:55.200 --> 03:58.760
Royal Knights, prepare to charge!

03:58.760 --> 04:01.200
Follow me!

04:16.690 --> 04:18.630
Th-They're strong!

04:18.630 --> 04:20.050
Yeah, no doubt.

04:20.520 --> 04:22.760
All right. Let's go, Yuhi! Can you run?

04:22.760 --> 04:24.450
Y-Yeah!

04:35.500 --> 04:39.960
<b><i>Episode 1</i></b>

04:35.500 --> 04:39.960
<b><i>Summoned to Another World for a Second Time</i></b>

04:40.500 --> 04:46.050
Thank you for arriving at a time of 
national emergency, foreign heroes!

04:46.050 --> 04:51.430
<b>The Nation of Distinia</b>

04:46.720 --> 04:51.430
Our kingdom of Distinia is 
being invaded by demons.

04:51.730 --> 04:54.580
Similar to the war five years ago,

04:54.580 --> 04:58.890
a group of heroes has rushed to 
our aid from a foreign world!

04:58.890 --> 05:01.740
If this is not destiny, then what is?

05:01.740 --> 05:03.400
Heroes? What?

05:03.400 --> 05:05.310
What the heck is this about "destiny"?

05:06.680 --> 05:10.070
I'm sure you are all confused 
by this sudden turn of events,

05:10.070 --> 05:15.460
but the fact is that a hero who came to 
us from a foreign world five years ago

05:15.460 --> 05:18.460
ended the war raging across our world,
 Eclaire, and brought peace.

05:15.640 --> 05:18.460
<b>Monument to 
Commemorate Peace</b>

05:18.460 --> 05:21.040
<i>That was five years ago, huh?</i>

05:23.650 --> 05:27.320
I know this alien world is confusing to you,

05:27.320 --> 05:30.770
but please understand that we 
cannot see this as a coincidence.

05:31.330 --> 05:34.980
Could you please lend us aid?

05:35.400 --> 05:40.170
Lend aid? I don't know how to fight.

05:40.170 --> 05:43.690
But I don't want to get 
thrown out of the castle...

05:43.690 --> 05:47.300
If we have to do it, I guess 
it's better to stay here...

05:47.300 --> 05:52.410
Yeah, if we go outside and get attacked 
again, we'll definitely be done for.

05:53.950 --> 05:57.120
Thank you for your determination, everyone.

05:57.830 --> 06:00.190
We have prepared rooms for you.

06:01.070 --> 06:04.040
Please rest for today.

06:05.280 --> 06:07.130
What's going on?

06:08.260 --> 06:09.680
Yuki-kun...

06:09.680 --> 06:10.760
Don't worry.

06:11.550 --> 06:13.970
I won't let any danger come to you.

06:17.480 --> 06:18.330
Yeah.

06:28.410 --> 06:30.850
Don't let your swing waver, 
even unconsciously!

06:31.320 --> 06:33.780
Make the proper form second nature!

06:34.350 --> 06:36.810
Magic is a manifestation 
of your mental image.

06:42.370 --> 06:45.250
Try to create a solid image inside you.

06:47.650 --> 06:48.720
Huh?

06:51.740 --> 06:53.570
I-I did it!

06:55.810 --> 06:58.150
Yuhi has talent.

07:03.200 --> 07:06.170
Slacking off on your first day? 
That's not very admirable.

07:06.170 --> 07:08.030
Ack... Elka!

07:08.740 --> 07:10.400
We're going to war.

07:10.400 --> 07:13.280
Addressing your superior officer 
like that is not permissible.

07:13.280 --> 07:17.510
Sheesh, who cares how I address you?

07:17.510 --> 07:21.080
Why don't you add "-sama" to your name,
 if that's what you want?

07:22.920 --> 07:26.000
Your calm composure in an alien 
environment is commendable,

07:26.000 --> 07:29.620
but your selfish attitude reminds 
me of the hero from five years ago.

07:30.140 --> 07:35.390
Capricious, egotistical, and uncaring 
of how the women around him felt...

07:35.690 --> 07:40.110
In any case, this world is more 
dangerous than you might think.

07:40.110 --> 07:41.840
Return to your training,

07:42.830 --> 07:45.690
unless you want me to force you.

07:45.690 --> 07:50.030
Sounds fun. I'd like to see you try.

07:50.850 --> 07:56.740
I see. I guess a little pain
 is needed as a lesson.

08:12.640 --> 08:16.390
Th-This impact... Could it be...

08:16.740 --> 08:19.490
Remember me now?

08:19.490 --> 08:21.330
Se... Se...

08:23.170 --> 08:25.490
Setsu-sama!

08:25.490 --> 08:28.970
S-S-S-Setsu-sama! I-It's been such a long time!

08:28.970 --> 08:33.310
I've waited for this moment, 
to see you again, for so long!

08:33.310 --> 08:35.180
Er, yeah. Long time no see.

08:35.870 --> 08:37.950
How long are you gonna stay like that?

08:37.950 --> 08:40.940
Oh! My apologies! Yes, the chair, right away!

08:40.940 --> 08:42.580
No, I didn't ask for that...

08:43.320 --> 08:46.220
Ah, the weight of Setsu-sama!

08:46.220 --> 08:48.670
Oh, did you lose weight?

08:48.670 --> 08:51.380
Yeah, this body is built differently 
from the previous one.

08:52.230 --> 08:55.680
You know, it's kind of creepy that you can tell.

08:55.680 --> 09:00.460
I only feel pleasure from servitude 
when providing it to you!

09:00.460 --> 09:02.850
Oh, my master!

09:02.850 --> 09:06.900
<i>Her masochism has only accelerated 
since the last time...</i>

09:08.980 --> 09:10.420
What are you doing?

09:10.420 --> 09:11.400
Glein!

09:11.400 --> 09:14.950
It's Setsu-sama! Setsu-sama is back!

09:15.270 --> 09:19.910
Setsu-san? Wait, is that him?

09:20.850 --> 09:24.110
I guess it has to be, given Elka's state...

09:28.280 --> 09:30.040
Thea! Great news!

09:30.390 --> 09:31.490
Listen—

09:30.390 --> 09:34.210
Welcome back, Setsu. 
It's good to see you again.

09:36.640 --> 09:40.320
I knew you'd catch on quick, Thea.

09:42.740 --> 09:45.130
Even with your new look,

09:45.130 --> 09:48.270
I would never mistake 
your magic power, Setsu.

09:48.270 --> 09:53.320
I see. Magic is not my strong suit. I'm sorry.

09:53.320 --> 09:57.990
I-I kinda sorta knew, too! I just wasn't sure!

09:58.970 --> 10:00.660
Anyway...

10:01.610 --> 10:03.490
I'm back, as promised.

10:06.920 --> 10:08.120
I'm home.

10:10.550 --> 10:12.540
Welcome home, Setsu.

10:12.540 --> 10:14.100
I've been waiting for you.

10:14.100 --> 10:15.960
I had no doubt you were alive!

10:16.490 --> 10:18.050
Damn right I am!

10:20.150 --> 10:22.300
<i>I guess it's not a given, actually.</i>

10:24.270 --> 10:30.600
<i>They could have died in battle 
while I was gone from this world.</i>

10:31.850 --> 10:33.190
Is something wrong?

10:35.080 --> 10:38.200
The war with the demons, right?

10:42.590 --> 10:46.450
We have many questions 
for you, too, Setsu-sama.

10:47.730 --> 10:49.360
Let's go someplace else.

10:57.470 --> 11:02.930
So, how did you return 
to our world, Setsu-sama?

11:03.370 --> 11:06.990
There's no doubt that you're Setsu-san,

11:06.990 --> 11:09.640
but why do you look so different?

11:09.640 --> 11:14.910
From our point of view, you simply 
disappeared after that battle.

11:18.710 --> 11:22.090
To be honest, I don't know for sure, either.

11:28.730 --> 11:30.370
Toma!

11:30.370 --> 11:32.080
Setsu!

11:44.930 --> 11:46.510
What I know for sure is that

11:47.430 --> 11:51.390
I was reborn in a different world while 
keeping my memories and magic power,

11:52.520 --> 11:55.520
then got summoned into this world again.

11:56.190 --> 12:00.650
We don't know how you were summoned 
to our world from a different world.

12:01.020 --> 12:05.840
So, not to quote the princess,
 but this doesn't seem like a coincidence.

12:05.840 --> 12:09.620
The will of God is a mystery 
to ordinary men like us.

12:09.620 --> 12:12.160
Enough about me for now.

12:12.650 --> 12:15.540
What happened to Toma after all that?

12:15.820 --> 12:19.780
He could be behind this war, too, right?

12:20.550 --> 12:24.550
Are those demons being controlled by a curse?

12:25.510 --> 12:30.090
Yeah, that feeling in their 
magic power... I'm certain.

12:30.610 --> 12:32.060
It's a curse.

12:33.200 --> 12:36.390
Toma's the only one who could 
do something like that.

12:36.390 --> 12:40.690
We searched for him, too, 
like we searched for you, but...

12:41.370 --> 12:44.740
We weren't able to find anything.

12:44.740 --> 12:50.420
But seeing as Setsu is alive, 
Toma could be, too...

12:50.420 --> 12:51.350
Glein-sama!

12:52.930 --> 12:56.640
Glein-sama, the king requires 
your immediate presence.

12:56.640 --> 12:58.740
Please come to the throne room.

13:00.200 --> 13:01.420
Well, you heard him.

13:01.420 --> 13:04.300
Yikes. Sounds like trouble.

13:04.300 --> 13:06.130
It's not hard to imagine what's up.

13:06.630 --> 13:08.830
I'll be off, then.

13:11.380 --> 13:13.380
It's not easy being important.

13:13.380 --> 13:16.140
That was supposed to be your job, you know.

13:17.680 --> 13:21.570
As if I'd ever accept a stuffy job like that.

13:22.300 --> 13:26.980
My plan was to travel around 
this world after the war.

13:32.020 --> 13:34.980
I love this peaceful scenery.

13:34.980 --> 13:39.200
The peace that Setsu won for 
us has to be maintained.

13:39.200 --> 13:41.460
Yeah, you're right.

13:43.220 --> 13:47.350
<i>Toma, what are you thinking?</i>

13:49.030 --> 13:52.720
We should never have struck 
peace with the demons!

13:53.020 --> 13:57.980
Our kingdom will now declare 
all-out war on them!

14:00.920 --> 14:02.470
Please be patient, my king!

14:02.470 --> 14:05.820
The emissary we sent to the demonic 
continent has not sent back word yet!

14:06.530 --> 14:09.700
We must first accurately 
understand the situation.

14:11.420 --> 14:14.940
It's the demons who've begun an 
unprovoked invasion against us.

14:15.410 --> 14:22.380
The new heroes being summoned at the same 
time is proof that justice is on our side.

14:25.160 --> 14:25.900
Hmph.

14:26.730 --> 14:31.130
We never should have listened to the 
hero's cheap words five years ago

14:31.130 --> 14:32.800
and agreed to that peace charter.

14:33.140 --> 14:39.690
That hero going missing feels to me 
like God wants us to unify the world.

14:52.030 --> 14:54.860
Yes! Success!

14:54.860 --> 14:56.500
Good job, Yuhi.

14:57.720 --> 15:01.130
Y-Yuki-kun?! You surprised me!

15:01.130 --> 15:03.710
Don't sneak up on me like that!

15:04.260 --> 15:06.080
I saw your other attempt, as well.

15:06.080 --> 15:08.750
You seem to have a knack for magic.

15:08.750 --> 15:10.340
You think so?

15:15.410 --> 15:16.490
What's wrong?

15:17.840 --> 15:22.120
This is practice to hurt someone, isn't it?

15:23.120 --> 15:24.350
Well...

15:25.330 --> 15:28.660
Why would anyone go to war?

15:28.660 --> 15:29.530
Yuhi...

15:37.650 --> 15:41.910
But if I really have a talent for magic,

15:43.800 --> 15:47.090
I'll protect you, Yuki-kun.

15:47.470 --> 15:48.510
Yuhi...

15:49.470 --> 15:54.940
Yeah, just overthinking something 
never changes anything.

16:02.800 --> 16:05.650
There you are, Setsu-sama.

16:10.360 --> 16:12.620
I was able to buy us some time

16:12.620 --> 16:14.950
by saying the heroes need more training,

16:15.970 --> 16:19.450
but all-out war seems 
unavoidable at this point.

16:19.810 --> 16:21.170
I'm sorry.

16:21.170 --> 16:22.760
Oh, well.

16:30.390 --> 16:35.220
Right, then. I guess I'll go out 
and stop the war by myself again.

16:36.240 --> 16:37.470
Setsu-sama?

16:38.760 --> 16:42.390
War is stupid. It has to be stopped.

16:42.390 --> 16:45.440
Especially if Toma is behind it.

16:47.090 --> 16:48.440
Setsu...

16:48.860 --> 16:53.990
Then we will follow you, 
as your personal guard!

16:53.990 --> 16:57.180
It would be great to fight 
alongside you again.

16:57.180 --> 17:02.360
Researching magic is fun, 
but traveling together is more fun.

17:02.360 --> 17:04.890
No. This time around, I'm going alone.

17:06.450 --> 17:10.340
Given the situation, 
you can't all leave this place.

17:10.910 --> 17:14.620
Besides, if Toma really is behind this,

17:14.620 --> 17:17.470
there needs to be enough of a 
fighting force staying here, as well.

17:17.470 --> 17:18.550
But...

17:19.040 --> 17:21.640
If you're my personal guard, 
you'll listen, right?

17:23.660 --> 17:28.690
How can I turn down a request like that?

17:28.690 --> 17:30.570
Setsu is cruel.

17:31.030 --> 17:36.910
Okay. Now I have to go and get what I need.

17:48.930 --> 17:50.770
Why are there so many people?

17:50.770 --> 17:53.900
We're going to war. Everyone's preparing.

17:53.900 --> 17:57.330
Elka, I'm going in. Glein, cover me.

17:57.330 --> 17:58.780
Wait, Elka!

17:58.780 --> 18:00.770
Let's do this peacefully!

17:59.710 --> 18:03.900
Feels like going back to 
our dungeon crawling days.

18:03.900 --> 18:08.100
Yeah. Most of the time, 
Elka would dive in head-first and...

18:08.100 --> 18:09.230
Sorry!

18:11.930 --> 18:14.030
Oh, no, old habits...

18:14.560 --> 18:16.780
I said we should do this peacefully...

18:17.820 --> 18:19.910
Well, as long as no one finds him.

18:19.910 --> 18:21.780
You think they won't?

18:21.780 --> 18:23.330
It's a matter of time.

18:24.160 --> 18:25.150
It's open.

18:25.150 --> 18:25.790
Good!

18:27.550 --> 18:28.670
Huh?

18:28.910 --> 18:30.340
Yuki-kun?

18:31.460 --> 18:33.760
Yuhi, we're going without you!

18:33.760 --> 18:35.130
Oh, sorry!

18:46.550 --> 18:48.810
Ah, here it is.

18:50.080 --> 18:53.980
Long time no see to you, too, Kuromaru!

18:55.110 --> 18:55.970
What?!

18:55.970 --> 18:57.110
Hey, are you all right?!

18:57.450 --> 18:59.300
Guards! Lock down the gates!

18:59.300 --> 19:00.530
Don't let them escape!

19:02.460 --> 19:04.730
They must've found out.

19:05.620 --> 19:08.540
I'll buy us some time within the castle.

19:09.230 --> 19:11.280
I guess I have to help him.

19:11.280 --> 19:14.330
Elka, follow Setsu. You'll get in our way.

19:14.330 --> 19:15.040
Hey!

19:15.040 --> 19:17.450
She's right and you know it. Come on.

19:17.450 --> 19:19.050
Oh, Setsu-sama!

19:19.050 --> 19:22.340
Please, don't be so forceful!

19:25.270 --> 19:28.270
Good. Everything is ready.

19:28.790 --> 19:34.160
We'll try to buy as much time 
as possible until you return.

19:34.160 --> 19:35.320
I'm counting on you.

19:35.320 --> 19:36.570
Yuki-kun!

19:42.190 --> 19:45.530
Wh-Why? Where are you going?!

19:45.960 --> 19:47.330
Hanabashira-san...

19:47.330 --> 19:50.480
No. It's all right, Elka.

19:52.660 --> 19:57.000
To tell you the truth, this is actually the 
second time I've been summoned to this world.

19:57.530 --> 19:58.860
Second time?

19:58.860 --> 20:03.540
So, to stop this war, I'm going 
to go meet an old acquaintance.

20:04.740 --> 20:08.260
If you're going somewhere, 
I'm going with you!

20:08.260 --> 20:10.350
I want to go with you!

20:10.740 --> 20:15.280
I promise I'll be useful! So please, I...

20:15.280 --> 20:17.820
No. It's too dangerous for you, Yuhi.

20:18.360 --> 20:22.780
Besides, this is something I have to do.

20:23.220 --> 20:26.170
Then that's all the more reason...

20:29.420 --> 20:33.580
I'm going because I don't 
want to put you in danger.

20:34.160 --> 20:35.290
You understand, don't you?

20:36.070 --> 20:38.210
Yuki-kun...

20:45.010 --> 20:48.980
Yeah, you're a kind person.

20:51.140 --> 20:54.540
Hey, close your eyes for a moment.

20:54.540 --> 20:55.350
My eyes?

20:56.630 --> 20:57.740
What for?

20:57.740 --> 20:59.010
Just do it.

21:00.070 --> 21:01.320
Like this?

21:16.710 --> 21:20.270
Wind magic and fire magic? Nice!

21:20.270 --> 21:21.210
I know, right?

21:21.880 --> 21:25.630
I'll do my best to get strong,

21:25.630 --> 21:29.080
so that I can protect you in this world, too!

21:30.600 --> 21:31.350
Ow!

21:31.830 --> 21:32.930
What was that for?!

21:33.710 --> 21:37.270
If you can dodge that the next 
time I see you, you pass the test.

21:39.480 --> 21:41.770
All right, I'm off!

21:42.030 --> 21:42.840
Right!

23:26.980 --> 23:31.920
<b><i>Next Time</i></b>

23:26.980 --> 23:31.920
<b><i>Going on a Trip for a Second Time</i></b>

23:27.780 --> 23:30.840
Next time, "Going on a 
Trip for a Second Time."
